        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lucy Maud Montgomery, Jan Karon\n- Roles: author, novelist\n- Works: Anne of Green Gables\n- Topics: Canadian literature, American literature\n\nFacts:\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was born on November 30, 1874, and died on April 24, 1942.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery published under the name L.M. Montgomery.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was a Canadian author.\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery began a novel series with Anne of Green Gables.\n- Jan Karon is an American novelist.\n- Jan Karon writes for both adults and young readers.",
